@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC04 Quan ly POI va dang ky sap

actor "Admin / ContentAdmin / Vendor" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - PoiPage va PoiFormModal" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nPoisController + PoiService + FileUploadService + SoftDeleteService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nPoiRepository + UserRepository + DeletedRecordRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach hoac form POI
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc danh sach
Business -> Business: Kiem tra vai tro va loc owner neu la Vendor
Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI theo bo loc
DataAccess -> Database: Doc du lieu POI
Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach
DataAccess --> Business: Tra ket qua
Business --> UI: Hien thi danh sach

alt Tao hoac cap nhat POI
  Actor -> UI: Nhap thong tin, toa do va chon anh
  UI -> UI: Kiem tra du lieu form
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau luu POI
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen, owner va du lieu
  alt Hop le
    Business -> DataAccess: Kiem tra POI/user va ghi thay doi
    DataAccess -> Database: Tao hoac cap nhat POI
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    DataAccess --> Business: Tra POI moi
    Business --> UI: Tra ket qua thanh cong
    UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach va trang thai
  else Khong hop le, khong ton tai hoac sai owner
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
    UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi
  end
else Admin xoa mem POI
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau xoa
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen quan ly noi dung
  Business -> DataAccess: Danh dau xoa va ghi tombstone
  DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat POI va DeletedRecord
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach
else Admin khoi phuc POI
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau khoi phuc
  Business -> DataAccess: Tim POI ke ca da xoa va bo DeletedAt
  DataAccess -> Database: Ghi POI da khoi phuc
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach
end
@enduml
